<label><span>Exact pattern repeat</span> <span data-lu="s"></span><input type="number" inputmode="decimal" min="0" step="0.1" id="rp" placeholder="optional"></label>
</div>
<p class="hint">Roll width, length and pattern repeat are printed on the label. The standard roll is about 52 to 53 cm (20.5 in) wide and 10.05 m (33 ft) long. We add 10 cm (4 in) to every drop for trimming.</p>
</details>
