<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Wallpaper Calculator FAQ</h2>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading">How many rolls of wallpaper do I need for a feature wall?</h3>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">A feature wall 3 m (about 10 ft) wide and 2.4 m (8 ft) high needs 2 standard rolls with no pattern repeat: six drops, four drops per roll on a 2.4 m wall. A 4 m wall with a large repeat needs 3. Add one spare roll from the same batch.</p>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading">How many rolls of wallpaper for a 12 x 12 room?</h3>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">A 12 x 12 ft room with 8 ft walls needs about 10 standard 20.5 in x 33 ft rolls: 48 ft of wall all the way around is 29 drops, and each roll gives three drops once you allow for trimming. Buy 11 to have a spare. Doors and windows are not taken off.</p>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading">How many drops do you get from a roll of wallpaper?</h3>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">A standard 10.05 m roll gives four drops on a wall about 2.4 m high with no pattern repeat, and three drops with a repeat of up to 64 cm. On taller walls or with a large repeat you may only get two or three drops per roll.</p>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading">Should I subtract doors and windows when measuring for wallpaper?</h3>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Usually not. You still need drops above and below doors and windows, and cutting around them wastes paper. Measure the full wall and only subtract very large openings, such as a wide patio door or a wall of windows.</p>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading">More Room Planning Tools</h2>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Decorating a bedroom? Our <a href="https://dailyspacehacks.com/box-room-bedroom-ideas/">box room bedroom ideas</a> and <a href="https://dailyspacehacks.com/small-bedroom-storage-ideas/">small bedroom storage ideas</a> help you plan the rest, and wallpaper is one of the easiest ways to dress up a small <a href="https://dailyspacehacks.com/powder-room-decor-ideas/">powder room</a> or <a href="https://dailyspacehacks.com/downstairs-toilet-ideas/">downstairs toilet</a>. For soft furnishings, try our <a href="https://dailyspacehacks.com/curtain-size-calculator/">curtain size calculator</a> and <a href="https://dailyspacehacks.com/rug-size-calculator/">rug size calculator</a>.</p>



